Package: gcTMB
Title: Fitting Growth Curves Using the Template Model Builder
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Emil", "Skindersoe", , "e.skindersoe@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0009-0000-2172-1614"))
Description: Fits non-linear growth curves over time, optionally with
    covariates on the parameters and random effects, by maximum likelihood
    using the Template Model Builder ('TMB'), with the Laplace approximation
    for the random effects. The logistic and Gompertz growth models are
    available, parameterised by the asymptote, the time of the maximum growth
    rate and a scale (or rate) parameter, and the response can follow a
    Gaussian, lognormal, Poisson, binomial, beta, beta-binomial or negative
    binomial distribution. The times at which the curves reach a level of
    their asymptote and their standard errors are derived by automatic
    differentiation.
